{"id":"n51545-2-5","stage":3,"title":"마땅히 · 合适","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n51545-2-5-1","ko":"이번 일에 참여할 사람 구했어요?","zh":"这次的活动找到要参与的人了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"일에","meaning":"事情","explanation":"일：事情；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"6","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일에","audio":"/audio/2330199cec2ec7a0ebde.mp3"}},{"text":"참여할","meaning":"参与，出席","explanation":"참여하다：参与，出席；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"참여하다","audio":"/audio/9e39b706c0f79a35cd7b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24871","senseId":"1","lemma":"참여하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참여할","audio":"/audio/494bd0e74d3c6c331fe5.mp3"}},{"text":"사람","meaning":"人手","explanation":"사람：人手","readings":[{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58161","senseId":"5","lemma":"사람","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"사람","audio":"/audio/389e7564ae2551b4f94d.mp3"}},{"text":"구했어요?","meaning":"找，弄，求","explanation":"구하다：找，弄，求；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"구하다","audio":"/audio/288eb4bbfc0c27cc5bf6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58299","senseId":"1","lemma":"구하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구했어요","audio":"/audio/cf902704b1085f19cbdc.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"i